# Do not send work to derdilla

This repo is [Zyzto/blood-pressure-monitor-fl](https://github.com/Zyzto/blood-pressure-monitor-fl), a fork of [derdilla/blood-pressure-monitor-fl](https://github.com/derdilla/blood-pressure-monitor-fl).

Upstream does not accept AI-written contributions. Do not treat derdilla as a place to land this work.

- Never `git push` to `derdilla`, `upstream`, or any remote whose URL is `derdilla/blood-pressure-monitor-fl`.
- Never open a PR, issue, or comment on derdilla unless the user explicitly names that repo and asks for that action.
- Never suggest pushing there, filing there, "contributing back", or syncing a stack onto derdilla.
- `origin` is the fork. Push and open PRs only on `Zyzto/blood-pressure-monitor-fl`.

```
# BAD
git push upstream HEAD
gh pr create --repo derdilla/blood-pressure-monitor-fl
"Want me to open this on derdilla?"

# GOOD
git push -u origin HEAD
gh pr create --repo Zyzto/blood-pressure-monitor-fl
```
